CHAPTER.VERS:
Though 

          His purpose is to prove Job to be a wicked man, and a hypocrite, because God punished him, and changed his prosperity into adversity.
         his excellency mount up to the heavens, and his head reach unto the clouds;

Though wickedness be 

          As poison that is sweet in the mouth brings destruction when it comes into the body: so all vice at the first is pleasant, but God later turns it to destruction.
         sweet in his mouth, [though] he hide it under his tongue;
